          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Stats become a compact 3+2 grid (about 130 px instead of 5 full-width cards). Without a header row, phones get explicit 'Alle' and 'Sortieren' controls. The bulk action moves into a selection bar that only appears when something is selected. Each card shows the name, organisation, date, rating dot with its label, and a status chip (no legend needed). Expanding a card shows email, rating (four 44 px buttons instead of tiny dots), the application and earlier courses.",
